# Waste2Value

> AI-powered platform that helps people identify, understand, and give unwanted items a second life through reuse, recycling, and circular-economy opportunities.

## About

Waste2Value is a smart waste-management and circular-economy platform designed to transform unwanted items into opportunities for reuse and recycling.

Users can submit an item, analyze it using AI-powered image recognition, understand its material and potential value, and discover suitable circular-economy options.

The platform combines AI, sustainability, and community-driven reuse into one modern web application.

## Features

- AI Item Analysis — Analyze uploaded item images using Google Gemini multimodal AI.
- Circular-Economy Recommendations — Identify opportunities for reuse, recycling, or repurposing.
- Image-Based Analysis — Upload an item image for automated assessment.
- Authentication — Secure user signup, login, sessions, and password recovery.
- Impact Tracking — Track environmental and circular-economy impact.
- Receiver Network — Connect reusable items with potential receivers.
- Secure Backend — Supabase authentication, PostgreSQL, Row Level Security, and Edge Functions.
- Responsive UI — Designed for desktop, tablet, and mobile experiences.

